<p>While in your spectral form from Ghost Walk and for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 3, 4</acronym> turns afterwards, you gain vision of all enemies within radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8, 8, 9, 9, 10.</acronym></p><p>In addition, at all times you gain the ability to sense undead within <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">11, 12, 13, 14, 15</acronym> tiles, and can perceive any foe within <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> tiles of your necrotic minions.</p>